      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks. the knocking is kinda rhythmic though, like it's actually hitting the side of the tank every few seconds. it's driving me mad. is there anything i can check myself before i pay for a plumber to come out? like i've got a screwdriver and a wrench but i don't want to break anything.",
